  dialog:
  - icon: {fileID: -4569357066326794538, guid: 1ea425f96adc68947a381bf3fe74fd9a, type: 3}
    text: Oh hello i saw you yesterday. Arent you newice there? i m a mayor of town.
    Name: Mayor
    Player: 0
  - icon: {fileID: -4569357066326794538, guid: 1ea425f96adc68947a381bf3fe74fd9a, type: 3}
    text: Good morning. You are right. i m an owner of pumpkin farm.
    Name: Player
    Player: 1
  - icon: {fileID: -4569357066326794538, guid: 1ea425f96adc68947a381bf3fe74fd9a, type: 3}
    text: Glad you came to town. And annoucment that you are a farmer is also good,
      because hallowen is coming, and town have to be decorated. Can you grow some
      pumpkins for town
    Name: Mayor
    Player: 1
  - icon: {fileID: -4569357066326794538, guid: 1ea425f96adc68947a381bf3fe74fd9a, type: 3}
    text: Hallowen i love it a lot, i will help.
    Name: Player
    Player: 1
